{"body":{"history":[{"content":"Habari! I'm your AI business coach. I can help you in English or Kiswahili. How can I assist your business today?","role":"assistant"},{"content":"what are your capabilities?","role":"user"},{"content":"I can help you run your shop smoothly by handling:\n\n- **Products**: List, view details, add new items (with price, cost, stock) and keep track of low‑stock alerts.  \n- **Customers**: See all customers, add new ones, and store their contact info.  \n- **Orders**: List existing orders, create new ones, and check their status (created, pending, paid, shipped, etc.).  \n- **Payments**: Initiate M‑Pesa STK Push payments for orders and verify if they’ve been completed.  \n- **Sales & Revenue**: Record sales, view daily/overall revenue, and get a quick financial snapshot.  \n- **Expenses**: Add and track business expenses (rent, salaries, stock purchases, etc.).  \n- **WhatsApp Communication**: Send text or media messages to customers, or broadcast promotional ads to many at once.  \n- **Summaries**: Provide a concise daily/weekly report covering sales, pending orders, low‑stock items, and overall profit.\n\nJust let me know what you need—whether it’s checking inventory, creating a new product, sending a payment request, or getting a business overview—and I’ll take care of it for you. 🚀","role":"assistant"}],"message":"what are my sales?"},"level":"info","message":"Request: POST /api/chatbot/chat","params":{},"query":{},"timestamp":"2026-03-25T08:29:44.699Z"}
