{"body":{"history":[{"content":"Habari! I'm your AI business coach. I can help you in English or Kiswahili. How can I assist your business today?","role":"assistant"},{"content":"Habari, biashara yangu inaendeleaje?","role":"user"},{"content":"Habari! 👋  \nKwa kuzingatia biashara yako, tunaweza kutatua hali hii kwa hatua rahisi:\n\n1. **Angalia ratiba ya mchakato** – Pakua data za mapato, punguzo la gharama na roo.  \n2. **Jisikia tabia ya majirani** – Je, unafika mahitaji ya wateja au haina ushindani?  \n3. **Angalia uzalishaji** – Ni kiasi gani cha bidhaa ambacho unapokauka zaidi au ndani ya mizani?  \n4. **Panga malengo thabiti** – Tumia data hii kufanya mipango ya mabadiliko yanayoweza kufanya mabadiliko taa.\n\nNinaweza kusaidia kwa kunywa mifumo hii au kufanya mchakato wa kuhakisha taarifa. Unaweza kuelezea zaidi kuhusu aina ya data unayotaka kutatua, au kipindi cha mwisho unaona kufikia?  \n\n**Natumai ni nini unahitaji?** 🙌","role":"assistant"}],"language":"en","message":"How can I increase my sales?"},"level":"info","message":"Request: POST /api/chatbot/chat","params":{},"query":{},"timestamp":"2026-05-14T07:28:29.709Z"}
